# Files azd should not push to App Service.
#
# node_modules is excluded and the dependencies are installed on the server by
# Oryx, driven by SCM_DO_BUILD_DURING_DEPLOYMENT in infra/resources.bicep.
# These two settings are a pair and must always move together. Excluding
# node_modules without the remote build gives you "Cannot find package
# 'express'" at container start.
#
# The first deployment is slow, because Oryx installs from scratch. On this
# sample it has taken over five minutes, which is longer than azd waits before
# printing "no App Service deployment status change". That warning means azd
# stopped watching, not that the deployment failed. Check the app itself
# rather than trusting the warning: see the README section on it.
.azure/
.git/
infra/
scripts/
node_modules/
README.md
azure.yaml
